---
import { profile, allProjects, skillGroups, infrastructure } from '../data/portfolio';
const payload = {
  profile: { name: profile.name, role: profile.role, location: profile.location, about: profile.about, github: profile.github, email: profile.email, linkedin: profile.linkedin },
  projects: allProjects.map(({ slug, title, status }) => ({ slug, title, status })),
  skills: skillGroups.map(({ title, skills }) => ({ title, skills })),
  infrastructure: infrastructure.layers.map(({ title, tool, description }) => ({ title, tool, description })),
};
---
<dialog id="portfolio-terminal" class="terminal-dialog" aria-labelledby="terminal-title" aria-describedby="terminal-description">
  <div class="terminal-header"><div><span class="terminal-mark" aria-hidden="true">&gt;_</span><h2 id="terminal-title">La otra forma de conocerme</h2></div><button type="button" data-terminal-close aria-label="Cerrar terminal">×</button></div>
  <div class="terminal-subheader"><span class="mono">SADEK / PORTFOLIO INTERACTIVO</span><span class="mono">ESC PARA CERRAR</span></div>
  <p id="terminal-description">Explora mi trabajo con comandos. Prueba <strong>help</strong> o elige un acceso rápido.</p>
  <div class="terminal-shortcuts" role="group" aria-label="Comandos rápidos">{['about', 'projects', 'skills', 'infra', 'contact'].map(command => <button type="button" data-command={command}>{command}<span aria-hidden="true">↵</span></button>)}</div>
  <div class="terminal-output" role="log" aria-label="Respuestas de la terminal" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions" tabindex="0"><div class="terminal-welcome"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>Ideas, código y curiosidad.<br /><span>Bienvenido a mi pequeño rincón de la web.</span></p></div></div>
  <form class="terminal-form" autocomplete="off"><label for="terminal-input"><span aria-hidden="true">~ $</span><span class="sr-only">Comando de la terminal</span></label><input id="terminal-input" type="text" maxlength="120" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" placeholder="Escribe help para empezar…" aria-describedby="terminal-hint" /><button type="submit" aria-label="Ejecutar comando">↵</button></form>
  <p id="terminal-hint" class="terminal-hint mono">ENTER ejecutar · ↑ ↓ historial · ESC cerrar</p>
  <script id="terminal-payload" type="application/json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(payload).replace(/</g, '\\u003c')} />
</dialog>
<script>
  import '../scripts/terminal';
</script>
